msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports several kinds of object avoidance. Avoidance of Airborne "
"Vehicles (ADSB) and Object Avoidance (Object/Ground/Ceiling)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持多种避障方式：空中飞行器规避（ADSB）和物体避障（物体/地面/天花板）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:9
#: 279d364bde5d4bc3822c9d8a74f5ead8 4274ab29a96d469cb5414c1c0be68cf0
#: 87fc05f7a43849579c4370aa1e4ff248
msgid ""
"Supported types vary with vehicle (Plane only supports ADSB). Some kinds of "
"avoidance require external hardware, such as ADSB receivers or  "
"Rangefinders."
msgstr "支持的类型因飞行器而异（固定翼仅支持 ADSB）。某些避障类型需要外部硬件，例如 ADSB 接收机或测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-object-avoidance-landing-page.rst:12
